# This repository is generated

Everything here is built from [{{source_repo}}](https://github.com/{{source_repo}})
(commit `{{source_commit}}`) by `scripts/build_mirror.py`. Edits made here are
overwritten on the next sync.

- To change the lifecycle, the playbook, the guards or the installer, change
  the source repository.
- The files under `templates/` and `playbook/` are what gets installed into
  *other* repositories — they are not instructions for working on this one.
